blueprint-compiler (0.10.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload
  * d/control: Stop generating from d/control.in
  * d/control: Explicitly depend on gir1.2-girepository-2.0.
    This is currently a virtual package provided by gir1.2-glib-2.0, but
    will need to be split out from gir1.2-glib-2.0 before the transition
    to GNOME 46 (GLib 2.79.x) packages, so depend on the canonical name
    representing the library that is actually imported.

